=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data source (web useTranslation; the six snapshots fed by the Dashboard page hooks): bound
    through the P1/S8 seam LiveTelemetrySource→LiveTelemetryModel. The view never issues HTTP;
    the source resolves the snapshot + unit prefs and pushes coalesced updates.
  - Composition (web section divider + grid[6 × GlassPanel]):
      • Section header -> web <Cog/> {t('telemetry.title','Live Telemetry')} uppercase divider,
        plus a freshness chip while fetching / stale / offline.
      • GlassPanel    -> TelemetryPanelCard over TSGlassPanel with the web <h4><Icon/> {title}>.
      • Drivetrain    -> Torque (RAW `${di_torque} Nm`), Motor Temp (fmtInt(toTempDisplay)+unit),
        Gear badge (cleanNil text; D=success/R=danger/else neutral), G-Force
        (fmtNumber(max(|lat|,|lon|),2)+"g"). Per-panel <SkeletonRows/> when data is nil.
      • Climate       -> Cabin/Outside temp, HVAC `${fmtNumber(p,1)} kW`, fan bar (n/6 +
        gradient), defrost / battery-heater pills, "No active modes" caption.
      • Security      -> Lock (🔒/🔓 → lock.fill/lock.open.fill, emerald/rose), Sentry
        (Active/Off, cyan/muted), Doors / Windows "All Closed" | "N Open" badges
        (success/warning) computed from the split door_state + the four window fields.
      • Tire Pressure -> 2×2 corner tiles (FL/FR/RL/RR) tinted by the raw-bar band
        (<2.068||>3.103 critical, <2.275||>2.896 warning, else normal), value =
        fmtNumber(toPressureDisplay(bar),1), unit suffix, + "All Normal"|"Warning" summary.
      • Media         -> now-playing title/artist (cleanNil; artist→"Unknown artist"), status
        badge (Playing=success/Paused=warning/else neutral), volume `${v}/${max}` + bar.
      • Navigation    -> Destination (`name || '—'`), Distance (fmtNumber(toDistanceDisplay,1)+
        unit), ETA (`fmtInt(min) min`), Home/Work/Favorite pills, "No saved location" caption.
  - Unit conversion: convertTemp/Distance/PressureFromSI ported 1:1 (constants 1609.344,
    6.894757, etc.); the display wrappers reproduce the Dashboard parent's wrapping —
    toDistanceDisplay(km)=convertDistanceFromSI(km*1000,…), toPressureDisplay(bar)=
    convertPressureFromSI(bar*100,…). The web `miles_to_arrival` field is carried VERBATIM and
    fed to the kilometre converter exactly as LiveTelemetry.tsx L340 does (documented in Data).
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a model/view test):
      loading (every panel skeleton) · empty (web-absent surface branch
      t('telemetry.empty','Awaiting live telemetry')) · content (six-panel grid; a nil panel
      still shows its own skeleton, the web `data ? … : <SkeletonRows/>` branch) · error
      (message + Retry; native QueryError affordance) · stale (freshness chip + one guarded
      auto-refresh) · offline (cached readings kept + offline chip + banner).
  - i18n (P1/S10): web keys preserved VERBATIM — telemetry.{title,drivetrain,climate,security,
    tirePressure,media,navigation,torque,motorTemp,gear,gforce,cabin,outside,hvac,fan,defrost,
    batHeater,noModes,lock,locked,unlocked,sentry,active,off,doors,allClosed,open,windows,
    allNormal,warning,unknownArtist,status,volume,destination,distance,eta,home,work,favorite,
    noSavedLocation} (40); native chrome telemetry.{live,stale,offline,updating,staleBanner,
    offlineBanner,loadingPanel,empty,errorTitle,retry} (10). Every code-referenced i18n key is
    declared in LiveTelemetry.strings; referenced==declared VERIFIED (50==50, zero orphans;
    the lone extra grep hit `telemetry.viewOpened` is the Swift method call
    `self.telemetry.viewOpened(surface:)`, not a string key). NO English string literals in
    native code beyond locale-invariant unit symbols (Nm / kW / min / g).
  - Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every row / badge / chip / tile (combined "label, value"
    phrases via LiveTelemetryAccessibility), the freshness chip, and the Retry button; each
    panel/grid carries a contained a11y element; Dynamic-Type system fonts (Font.TS);
    reduce-motion honored (meter-bar fill + TSSkeleton shimmer).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): LiveTelemetryModel.start() emits view.opened with surface slug
    "LiveTelemetry" exactly once (OSLogLiveTelemetryTelemetry default; prod app injects the
    shared diagnostics adapter). Asserted by testStartAppliesInitialAndEmitsTelemetryOnce.

